### Base URL constant
@base_url = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### 接口：tasks
GET {{base_url}}/computer HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


### 接口：tasks
POST {{base_url}}/computer HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1002,
  "model": "MacBook Pro 15-inch 2026",
  "brand": "Apple"
}


